@NEW RT
@ABORT TCCOM
@CC ===========================================================
@CC   Loading TCCOM
@CC ===========================================================
@RT-LOADER
CLEAR-SEGMENT TCCOM
Y
NEW-SEG TCCOM,,,,,,,
SET-LOAD-ADDRESS TCCOM,0
LOAD (TCP-COMM)TCCOM,TCCOM,TCSHAR
LOAD (TCP-IP)SLIB-NRE-1B,,,
LOAD (TCP-IP)SLIB-REE-1B,,,
LOAD PLANC-UTILLIB-1B,,,,
LOAD MON-CALL-1B,,,,,
LOAD PLANC-1BANK,,,
WRITE-REF,,,
END-LOAD
END
EXIT
